nalities, Let Customers Make Orders, Let Sellers Receive Orders From Customers", "created_at": "2021-03-11T09:10:05Z", "repo": "techshelter-django-online-store", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "b4bd77864945ea994d21bbdcfd043cf1f4ce41d7", "message": "Privilege Sellers to Run CRUD Operations Only on Own Tech Items\n\nSeller can add own new tech items, and see, update or delete the ones which is only owned by the seller.\nAny visitor or user can visit a seller's stall page and can see seller's information and only the items owned by the seller.", "created_at": "2021-02-24T13:36:52Z", "repo": "techshelter-django-online-store", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "89d55a234e0345a3b800c3a1282ffbd369bb0ab1", "message": "Add Tech Model (to store Items), and Privilege Admin to operate CRUD\n\nTech model will store all new items and the TechShelter home page will show each one of those. Furthermore, a separate tech-management page will let an admin to see, add, update, delete any item into the Tech model.", "created_at": "2021-02-23T17:43:18Z", "repo": "techshelter-django-online-store", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "aa8f8d2c47a20a8b18a4dd8cd323924994b400aa", "message": "Privilege Admin to Edit User Profiles\n\nAn admin can now make any user an admin or manager, edit many information, deactivate account, and even delete any account and so on.", "created_at": "2021-02-23T07:07:24Z", "repo": "techshelter-django-online-store", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "ea9137822ad531cf234a315a2ecc5e57b697cfee", "message": "Add 'Edit Profile' Advantage\n\nAny user can now update own information in user profile page, and can see the link to that page in the user menu.", "created_at": "2021-02-22T15:28:59Z", "repo": "techshelter-django-online-store", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "0f2a512b1c767116130f971fd23c64c0951058b9", "message": "Privilege Admin to See All Users' Information\n\nOnly admin can see the page link which will show only to admin, some information of all users'. Admin also can see the link to the built-in Django Administration page in the user menu.", "created_at": "2021-02-22T08:40:14Z", "repo": "techshelter-django-online-store", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "b4063b275fe08f3cadbf87b6275da960e05bd366", "message": "Fix Log out Issue", "created_at": "2021-02-21T12:05:52Z", "repo": "techshelter-django-online-store", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "c4458e272e9046625d45b71956f9256b5363cd71", "message": "Fix User Sign up Issues", "created_at": "2021-02-21T05:01:53Z", "repo": "techshelter-django-online-store", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "2c3263ba4f613efa235ef78c4c27beaabf6ff619", "message": "Merge branch 'main' into beta", "created_at": "2021-02-20T04:47:35Z", "repo": "techshelter-django-online-store", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "875824032261b96eb6cac9d7ac16abb303953866", "message": "Add User Authentication Functionalities (Sign up, Log in, Log out))", "created_at": "2021-02-20T04:32:12Z", "repo": "techshelter-django-online-store", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "385870de4500649e517f8ce1d7419fcadfdd6eb0", "message": "Start TechShelterApp app\n\nJust started the app 'TechShelterApp' using the command 'python manage.py startapp TechShelterApp' in the project's main directory.", "created_at": "2021-02-19T07:41:55Z", "repo": "techshelter-django-online-store", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "f0f54240c494eaae5c040181a62a674e42cb4ca7", "message": "Start Django Project\n\nJust started the Django website project 'TechShelter Online EShop' us